<html>
<head>
<title>My Magic Word Lab</title>
<link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
body {background: lightyellow;}
h1, h3 {color: darkorange;}
.box {background: white; color: darkorange;}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="container py-4">
<h1 class="mb-1">my magic word lab</h1>
<p class="text-muted mb-4">discover types, switch then, find and swap words, and catch sneaky errors!</p>
<div class="card mb-4"><div class="card-body">
<h3 class="card-title">what type is it?</h3>
<button class="btn btn-warning" onclick="checktypes()">reveal the types!</button>
<div id="typeresult" class="box p-3 mt rounded">press the button to reveal the secret types!</div>
</div></div>
</div>
<div class="card mb-4"><div class="card body">
<h3 class="card-title">switch the tpye</h3>
<input id="numIn" class="form-controll mb-2" placeholder="type any number here (try: 42)">
<button class="btn btn-warning mr-2" onclick="tostr()">turn into text</button>
<button class="btn btn-warning mr-2" onclick="tonum()">turn into number</button>
<div id="convresult" class="box p-3 mt-3 rounded">type a number above then press a button!</div>
</div></div>
<div class="card mb-4"><div class="card body">
<h3 class="card-title">find and swap a word</h3>
<input id="findw" class="form-controll mb-2" placeholder="word to find (try: dragon)">
<input id="swapw" class="form-controll mb-2" placeholder="swap it with (try: wizarrd)">
<button class="btn btn-warning mr-2" onclick="dosearch()">find it!</button>
<button class="btn btn-warning mr-2" onclick="doreplace()">swap it!</button>
<div id="srResult" class="box p-3 mt-3 rounded">sentence: "the dragon flew over the big castle."</div>
</div></div>
<div class="card mb-4"><div class="card body">
<h3 class="card-title">catch the mistake</h3>
<input id="divin" class="form-controll mb-2" placeholder="divide 100 by this-try a number or type something silly!">
<button class="btn btn-warning mr-2" onclick="trysafe()">try it!</button>
<div id="errResult" class="box p-3 mt-3 rounded">sentence: "type anumber or something silly and see what happens!"</div>
</div></div>
</body>
</html>